OL,3,GNEWSACouncils given funds to help
OL,4,Atackle rough sleeping
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal authorities in Cambridgeshire and
OL,7,FPeterborough are being given a share of
OL,8,Falmost #1.75m in government funding to
OL,9,Fhelp tackle rough sleeping.
OL,11,FThe money has been approved by Paul
OL,12,FBristow, the Conservative mayor of
OL,13,FCambridgeshire and Peterborough, with a
OL,14,Fview to giving people a route off the
OL,15,Fstreets by Christmas.
OL,17,FIt is part of the government's Rough
OL,18,FSleeping Programme.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
