OL,3,GNEWSACouncils given funds to help
OL,4,Atackle rough sleeping
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This funding will not only help change
OL,7,Fthe lives of those being given
OL,8,Fsomewhere to sleep but will also
OL,9,Faddress key regional issues that lead
OL,10,Fto someone ending up in this position,"
OL,11,Fsaid Bristow.
